cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite it as below. It is imported from the pinned commit; only the fatal-error path was changed.
title: lean-derive-hargup
abstract: >-
  A feed server for the twelve-dollar-server-challenge. The API is specified in Lean 4 (domain, a
  global invariant over the stored data, read plans proved equal to the specified results, the
  wire contract); a Lean program generates the C application layer, which is compiled with SQLite
  and a small io_uring runtime into one binary. Imported at the pinned commit, with exit() and abort() replaced by one rt_fatal hook; the
  challenge repository's MIT licence covers submissions.
